WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
One brief. The studio takes it from here.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Roughs, pick, polish, proof, sign-off. Five roles, one job.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Proof measures. 32 px inside a 38 px safe zone fails, and the job goes back.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Eight axes, every one at 8 or more, average 8.5 or more. Rounds until it passes.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Launch card, three rounds, $1.34.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Runs inside the coding agent you already use. deskstudio.ai
